{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》昨晚首播後掀起熱話，今晚第2集將迎來藍白兩隊激烈的電動車城市追逐戰。吳肇軒在遊 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》昨晚首播後掀起熱話，今晚第2集將迎來藍白兩隊激烈的電動車城市追逐戰。吳肇軒在遊戲中不僅瘋狂暴走兼爆響口，更意外連線重量級神秘人物令全場起哄。另一邊廂白隊卻爆出嚴重內鬨危機，某位成員在關鍵時刻竟化身「Team Killer」將隊友推向萬劫不復境地。</p>\n<h2>Ivy So貼身造型出戰高難度甫士搶Fo</h2>\n<p>今晚播出的第2集將焦點放在分組對抗，7位玩家正式分為藍白兩隊，駕駛電動車穿梭市區完成連串挑戰。藍隊陣容包括邱士縉、Alton及吳肇軒，而白隊則由郭嘉駿領軍，帶領沈貞巧、Ivy So與雷濠權作戰。Ivy So以貼身背心配超短褲上陣，遊戲期間不時擺出高難度姿勢，更一度整個人倒臥車頭，花式曬出纖腰長腿，畫面極為吸睛。比賽過程絕不輕鬆，兩隊必須爭分奪秒抵達指定地點完成任務。吳肇軒與Alton同隊後異常亢奮，在車廂內不斷暴走大開金口，演</p>\n<p>唱多首搞笑改編歌曲，將緊張刺激的賽事氣氛推向另一極端。</p>\n<h2>吳肇軒意外致電古老闆驚喜獻聲</h2>\n<p>賽事期間各人各出奇謀，吳肇軒在執行任務時竟然成功打通電話給「古老闆」，令這位重量級人物以聲音導航形式驚喜出演幾分鐘，瞬間震撼拍攝現場。另一邊廂被眾人嫌棄為「黑氣石」的雷濠權，對於連番遭到隊友排擠只能無奈苦笑。面對其他成員質疑，雷濠權坦言自己也想不出具備甚麼優點可以貢獻隊伍，這番自嘲言論令原本火藥味十足競技環節增添不少荒謬感。</p>\n<h2>嘉賓亞水大爆料震撼拍攝現場</h2>\n<p>戰況推進至白熱化階段，藍隊成功邀請神秘嘉賓協助闖關，卻意外將觀景點變成小型簽名會。樂隊R.O.O.T.成員亞水在鏡頭前突然大爆吳肇軒私人秘密，直指他私下擁有極多女性朋友，突如其來的爆料讓眾人措手不及。至於藍隊隊長邱士縉亦面臨殘酷2選1抉擇，經過激烈討論後決定選擇林渟並果斷放棄旨呈，這項戰術安排直接影響兩隊隨後在市區爭奪戰積分差距。</p>\n<h2>雷濠權化身最強團滅者網民爆笑</h2>\n<p>來到蒲公英與波板糖遊戲環節，雷濠權本來表現突出，卻在郭嘉駿作賽時於旁邊高呼「奶」及「聞」企圖提水，結果嚴重干擾對方節奏。郭嘉駿隨即喝令他站在中間干擾邱士縉，沒想到最終郭嘉駿依然慘敗，整個滑稽過程在網上引發熱烈討論。大量觀眾在各大討論區留言嘲笑這幕，有網民直指「Jason根本就係最強Team Killer」，亦有人表示「193畀神隊友搞到徹底崩潰真係超級好笑」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560087859481499_17935947286b06b1f016da8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Clapping woman beside a black car-2.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560087859481499_17935947286b06b1f016da8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560088783859503_17496314056b06b1f8671e0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"7fea0e87-0844-49bf-a9d1-09b0925e0846.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560088783859503_17496314056b06b1f8671e0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560089578337419_8928949126b06b2004f50c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Smiling man on a call in car-3.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560089578337419_8928949126b06b2004f50c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kootinlok_louis_1774158083_3858239499483180449_3444055839_2716067816a8d5f656771e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kootinlok_louis_1774158083_3858239499483180449_3444055839_2716067816a8d5f656771e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kootinlok_louis）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560090588281454_4360632136b06b20a713ba.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Smiling woman holds paper overhead-1.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560090588281454_4360632136b06b20a713ba.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956009145459520_2812240956b06b21308a88.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Restored outdoor TV frame with braided woman-5.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956009145459520_2812240956b06b21308a88.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e8%82%87%e8%bb%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳肇軒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%bc%aa%e7%9b%a4%e9%81%8a%e6%88%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">輪盤遊戲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e9%a7%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭嘉駿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550050\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.336553+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1422,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:30:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:10:40.897442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:20.581417+00:00","content_hash":"f07d6053e0a6f017accd32c9042fa9caaac37f458e17bf70d02b755c0b3ac496","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}